README File:

A The title of the homework and the author names (you and your partner)
    Project Gerp: Hansini Gundavarapu- hgunda01 and Jessica Charalel- jchara02

B The purpose of the program
    The purpose of the program is to implement a recreation of the program 
    grep, in which a user can use a program to look for a certain string
    and how many times it is found in a given directory of files. For example,
    when the program is given the files of a certain directory followed by the
    query "hello", gerp should be able to allow the user to see the iterations
    of that certain body of text in the following files and directories. There
    is also a distinction between textSensitive and textInsensitive in terms
    of if the user wants to differentiate lowercase text with uppercase and
    vice versa. 

