    gerp.cpp

    Makefile: Makefile linking all the files in the program together

    unit_tests.h: unit_testing framework used specifically for HashTable
    functions and implementation

    b, c, d, y: All testing files for the program - Used to be traversed and for
    query testing.
    
E How to compile and run your program
Compile program by running: make
Run ./gerp [any directory] [output file] - to run program.
"Query?" will be printed and run word search queries until you want to quit. 
Use @q to quit.

